      "body": "<!-- devin-review-comment {\"id\": \"BUG_pr-review-job-d6af4790986942dab6584f52b9a7a660_0001\", \"file_path\": \"recall-backend/services/textExtractor.ts\", \"start_line\": 30, \"end_line\": 30, \"side\": \"RIGHT\", \"based_on_repo_rules\": false, \"kind\": \"bug\"} -->\n\n🔴 **Cancelled README extraction clears saved text**\n\nWhen a GitHub fetch is aborted mid-request, `extractGitHubReadme` returns null instead of preserving text or cancelling the job. [processContent](https://github.com/sunnybagal/recall-seeded/blob/70451a11afa0954b3905e64aaf817d31818589d8/recall-backend/worker.ts#L94-L104 \"recall-backend/worker.ts:94-104\") then overwrites saved text and marks extraction done, without a retry.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Learn more</summary>\n\nThe worker stores the extractor's result as `extractedText` and marks the row done in both its short-text and normal completion paths ([processContent](https://github.com/sunnybagal/recall-seeded/blob/70451a11afa0954b3905e64aaf817d31818589d8/recall-backend/worker.ts#L61-L71 \"recall-backend/worker.ts:61-71\"), [processContent](https://github.com/sunnybagal/recall-seeded/blob/70451a11afa0954b3905e64aaf817d31818589d8/recall-backend/worker.ts#L94-L104 \"recall-backend/worker.ts:94-104\")). An abort during `fetch` is swallowed by the README loop's catch. On the next iteration, the new abort check returns null, even when the row already has short text. This commits a cancelled extraction as a successful empty extraction instead of allowing the job to retry.\n\n**Example:** A GitHub row has `extractedText = \"notes\"`. Its README request is aborted during shutdown. Extraction returns null, and the worker writes `extractedText = null` with status `done`, rather than retaining the notes and retrying later.\n\n**Recommended fix:** Propagate cancellation separately from ordinary README failures and let `processContent` leave the job unfinished or retryable. If aborted extraction must return a value instead, preserve `existingText` and prevent the worker from marking incomplete work done.\n\n</details>\n\n<!-- devin-review-badge-begin -->\n<a href=\"https://app.devin.ai/review/sunnybagal/recall-seeded/pull/2\" target=\"_blank\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://static.devin.ai/assets/gh-devin-review-dark.svg?v=4\"><img src=\"https://static.devin.ai/assets/gh-devin-review-light.svg?v=4\" alt=\"Devin Review\"></picture></a>\n<!-- devin-review-badge-end -->\n\n---\n*Was this helpful? React with 👍 or 👎 to provide feedback.*",
